@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Graderate

[*] --> Waiting

state "Waiting" as Waiting
state "Active" as Active
state "Expired" as Expired
state "Removed/Archived" as RemovedArchived

Waiting --> Active : Start date arrival
Active --> Expired : Finish date reached
Expired --> RemovedArchived : One year after expiration date

Expired --> [*]
RemovedArchived --> [*]

@enduml
